35,2,1,talk,Rin,,The log says one house filed eleven complaints. That is a lot.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,The ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen a year in extra fees.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The truck arrives between seven forty and eight fifteen.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,Supervised mornings take fifty minutes. That is twenty per year.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The frontages are uneven. One is only ninety centimetres wide.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, so the narrow one can't really host a bin?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, if the truck comes early, the window is tight.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, yes. It starts before some of us wake up.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Rin, the station block's bin house smells worse in summer.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, so an enclosure might just trap the smell?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,I don't want a sealed box that smells worse.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"The subsidy covers forty percent, capped at ninety thousand.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,A permanent build needs four months and five signatures.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,Rotating locations means new notices every time. That is work.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"If we rotate, the narrow house is still stuck with the smell.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,I think we need a clear schedule. No ambiguity.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. Managed hours seem the most balanced.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I can live with a strict window. It is predictable.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,I will vote for the one that minimizes my time.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I will vote for the one that is truly equal.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
